COMMON INTERVIEW TRAPS
======================

Q. Is GitHub Copilot a replacement for developers?

Answer:

No.

GitHub Copilot assists developers by generating suggestions.

Developers must review, test, and validate the generated code before
using it in production.

---

Q. Does GitHub Copilot automatically generate correct code every time?

Answer:

No.

The generated code can contain logical errors, security issues, or
inefficient implementations. Human review is always required.

---

Q. Does GitHub Copilot only support Java?

Answer:

No.

It supports many programming languages and works with multiple popular
IDEs.

